            "notes": "# Round 3 Notes \u2013 Kiriko \ud83e\udd8a\u2728\n\n## Power Choice:\n\n- [Two-Zu](item_80f16d3e-a4c0-4fa8-90b1-a0f033a1a77b) \u2192 grants a second Protection Suzu, doubling your lifesaving potential.\n\n## New Item:\n\n-[Talisman of Life](item_7ecfd3eb-d869-41fe-87eb-0bb2e82e5718) \u2192 +20% [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) and 5s of Overhealth from each Suzu cast.\n\n## Item Adjustments:\n\n- Sell Power [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418), [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0), and [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf). If you can afford them after [Talisman of Life](item_7ecfd3eb-d869-41fe-87eb-0bb2e82e5718), keep them!\n\nGameplan: With two Suzus and bonus overhealth, you become an anchor for your team. Use one Suzu defensively (to cleanse/save) and the second offensively (to enable pushes). Talisman\u2019s power spike makes each Suzu cast a momentum-shifting play.",
